{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8000_place", "source_sha256": "7e86c711772f2b68a2ca64a5b483509a398ffe36fb0088ed2832ae65221a55a9", "ja": "闇の病院", "zh": "黑暗医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8001_p", "source_sha256": "5839fedd1c7c7c8f032e4ad0038b6b92e59045b01403e71793c4ed0396a318f4", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影。\nテーマは、『闇世界の病院で働くナース』だ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。\n主题是“在黑暗世界的医院工作的护士”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8002_p", "source_sha256": "5a77b5d515ffe07888a381d6950bf3ff52312d92ae09cf8ab7f8379628197578", "ja": "衣装、すごく似合っているよ。\nテーマがちょっと特殊だけど……問題ないか？", "zh": "这套衣装很适合你。\n主题有点特别……没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8003_031tom", "source_sha256": "d25f274ec8845bd207272f9478ac98cc3c527c45dd9d3e58d3f91b72a6897d59", "ja": "もちろんです～。普段は奉仕を受ける側ですが、\nナースらしい奉仕の精神を表現してみせます～。", "zh": "当然啦～平时虽然是接受侍奉的一方，\n但我会展现出护士应有的服务精神～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8004_031tom", "source_sha256": "e173124e1a67ea0017e157fadabc83313fbe130e7c2f27947c5183d1d1566921", "ja": "そして、もうひとつ……\n『闇』という重要な特徴も忘れてはいませんよ～。", "zh": "而且，还有一个重要特征……\n我也没有忘记“黑暗”哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8005_p", "source_sha256": "4f66b8fd7c203c370fe03a9c05a6ffaef8f8ff21bf6e98b082115c89f92cd3fd", "ja": "そうだな。でも、そこをわかってるなら話が早い。\nこれは聖母である朋花がやることに意味があるんだ！", "zh": "没错。不过，既然你明白这一点，事情就好办了。\n这件事由身为圣母的朋花来做，才有意义！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8006_031tom", "source_sha256": "ff4c2d3807e3f7cc5cdece42892cd361555f91a618f47f9118d978364fc305ec", "ja": "{$P$}さんの奉仕は、\n少し独特すぎる気もしますが……まあ、いいでしょう。", "zh": "我觉得{$P$}先生的奉仕，\n稍微有点太独特了……不过，也罢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8007_031tom", "source_sha256": "707ab8d3b5afc7f505a662cc7cb0d6d905475155e046dcb13812b343755995e9", "ja": "もし心配なら、一度お見せしましょうか～。\nつまりは……こういうこと、ですよね♪", "zh": "要是担心的话，要不要给您演示一次呢～？\n也就是说……是这个样子，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8008", "source_sha256": "c3d4b2f7f63c553ce6ac99d702c4373da79a0dcdaf2106415e5c37f9a82e3025", "ja": "おお！", "zh": "哦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8009", "source_sha256": "73df446fff6d5cd2010abbdcdf9444d1513c44911782ee70f11e99c6ad4d370a", "ja": "これは……", "zh": "这个是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8010", "source_sha256": "7625dcd9bf18fb2d67772784c57633cb3e0dfb259e0424141c5c63dda4290845", "ja": "うっ！", "zh": "呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8100_031tom", "source_sha256": "7196520b2458fd413c622e1dae4e0f0f2d5a0111ba1ed1ac549f4c2134220edd", "ja": "うふふ、従順な患者さんですね♪\nさあ、次はお胸の音を聞きますよ～？", "zh": "呵呵，真是个顺从的病人呢♪\n来，接下来要听听胸口的声音咯～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8101_p", "source_sha256": "0b61afd72e506d98a53616d8c771f4e5ec2aaaa3d80d31493b0bd8db66dacb53", "ja": "そう、それだ！　清らかさの中に闇を感じる……！\nさすがだ、朋花！　この調子で……。", "zh": "对，就是这个！能从清纯之中感受到黑暗……！\n不愧是朋花！就保持这个状态……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8102_031tom", "source_sha256": "9f067b4f403afeb72591bdc0e298133015b85af835e2723a80bac8347db893ff", "ja": "言われなくても、全力でやりますよ～。\n見ていてくださいね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "不用你们说，我也会全力以赴的～。请好好看着吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8200_p", "source_sha256": "4915c1470c2439ce2214704de8ea665731078a803dfc97c7e0229d2914d7d0c0", "ja": "あれ？　なんだか心がじんわりとあたたかく……。\nなんだ、この多幸感は……！", "zh": "咦？感觉心里暖洋洋的……\n这股幸福感是怎么回事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8201_031tom", "source_sha256": "eac7028c11d4e53058d8aa7a6d89579f0133eaf461aad204832744d9ef90c14a", "ja": "うふふ♪　聖母の癒しです♪\nお気に召しましたか～？", "zh": "呵呵♪这是圣母的治愈哦♪\n您喜欢吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8202_p", "source_sha256": "da6f3d45daa880998745a8bd02939713c6b3dd7a9ba0b1a4288a76990cfbc12c", "ja": "すごいな、朋花。\nでも、このままじゃ仕事とかやる気がなくなって……。", "zh": "真厉害啊，朋花。\n不过这样下去，我会连工作什么的都提不起干劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8203_031tom", "source_sha256": "7aa012be47c2674bc17b8b47552c1307003b6552afc77a15935d3d6c94d48738", "ja": "それが狙いですから。患者さんは、ずーっと私の元で\n癒され続けてくださいね～。……逃がしませんよ♪", "zh": "因为那就是我的目标呀。所以，患者请一直在我的身边接受治愈吧～……我不会让您逃走的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8300_p", "source_sha256": "b07c4fc1e2df4a40d15f36715e23a59461d2f91792aa32e62d71deab8847ca2a", "ja": "（び、びっくりした……。\n突然顔を近づけてくるから、ど、動悸が……）", "zh": "（吓、吓我一跳……。\n她突然把脸凑过来，搞得我、我心跳都加快了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8301_031tom", "source_sha256": "6c9c347683c67225237f25968bf2b73f3c816a6cb87a7a2986ff117bb0403fee", "ja": "さあ、どこから調べましょうか～♪\nまずは瞳孔のチェックから……あら～？", "zh": "那么，我们从哪里开始检查呢～♪\n先从瞳孔检查开始……哎呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_031tom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_031tom_8302_031tom", "source_sha256": "41d28fa52c4dd728be712da5ee51abc3cf37937444eac43e232f78d6db173365", "ja": "顔が真っ赤ですね～。邪念を捨てて、\n真面目に仕事をしてください、ダメプロデューサー。", "zh": "脸红得很厉害呢～。快抛开邪念，认真工作吧，没用的制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
